meta {
  name: Present Test Card
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/restaurants/{{restaurant_id}}/terminal/readers/{{reader_id}}/test-card
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
}

docs {
  Local / test mode only: 404 on production or with a live Stripe key.
  Taps Stripe's test card on a simulated reader so the payment started by
  Terminal Payment completes (payment_intent.succeeded then records it).
  422 on terminal when the reader has no payment waiting.
  The demo reader is on Tax Test Bistro (restaurant 4, reader 1; guide v28 §64.3).
}
